 bare StopIteration, the slot's"] [664 3 "// Next ending with nil)"] [683 1 "// sortObjects sorts items in place by key (nil: the items) and reverse, stably: the keys computed in"] [684 1 "// order, then PY5b's SortObjects (list.sort's)."] [737 1 "// noFrameGlobals is the globals of a call with no Python frame: the running __main__'s"] [738 1 "// (_PyEval_GetGlobalsFromRunningMain), else a new dict."] [749 1 "// frameLocals is locals() of a frame (PEP 667): a module's or class's namespace (its mapping when that is no dict;"] [750 1 "// frameNamespace), else a new dict of a function's bound fast locals, cells and free variables, then its extra locals (the proxy's"] [751 1 "// snapshot, _PyEval_GetFrameLocals: a write to it does not reach the frame)."] [754 27 "// a call with no Python frame (an interpreter's call, queue 230)"] [786 1 "// builtinDir is dir(): the scope's names, or an object's __dir__() sorted (PY5c's lookup); without a"] [787 1 "// __dir__, a module's namespace, a type's and its bases', an object's type's and its __dict__'s."] [810 3 "// the object's __dir__ (object's, type's, module's, a class's own: PY5c's), its result sorted"] [826 3 "// the scope's names: a mapping not a dict (exec's locals; queue 219) by its keys"] [831 4 "// PyMapping_Keys"] [932 1 "// roundFloat is float.__round__ (Objects/floatobject.c's double_round): to an int, ties to even, without"] [933 1 "// ndigits; else the correctly rounded value at ndigits decimal places (round-half-even on the exact decimal"] [934 1 "// value, as dtoa's mode 3), negative ndigits rounding to tens, hundreds ..."] [956 2 "// the exact decimal value of x, rounded half-even at n places after the point"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[20 48] [26 49] [40 47] [58 46] [64 48] [74 52] [89 41] [99 48] [108 41] [121 41] [137 52] [140 32] [146 51] [178 31] [211 30] [220 60] [226 37] [234 43] [238 35] [243 32] [254 35] [281 46] [285 22] [295 28] [298 43] [328 34] [348 44] [403 45] [426 43] [440